                     <code code="44425-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="STORAGE AND HANDLING SECTION"/>
                     <title>STORAGE</title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>Store at room temperature 15-25°C (59-77°F); avoid freezing and excessive heat above 40°C (104°F).</paragraph>
